  "createdAt": "2026-09-06T14:23:45.094294Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T00:05:20.843171Z",
  "totalBlocks": 112,
  "translatedBlocks": 111,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8db7a8f7f525c6be",
      "translationZh": "随着代码库快速演进，架构文档始终是软件开发中最难解决的挑战之一。开发团队往往花费数小时手动创建架构图，却眼看着它们在部署后几周内就变得过时。这种文档缺口造成了知识孤岛，拖慢了开发人员的入职上手过程，也让合规审计变得更加复杂。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6217a18ca72c9e7",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 是一个支持使用任意框架或模型大规模构建、连接和优化智能体的平台。它通过自主智能体提供解决方案，这些智能体能够分析代码库、生成架构图，并自动维护可搜索的文档。这种智能体方法利用迭代优化和自我纠正，通过 AWS 服务协调代码分析、架构图生成和自动发布。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f5c167042029f2b",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，你将了解一家全球交易商间经纪公司如何构建自动化架构文档流水线，并将其集成到现有的持续集成和持续交付（CI/CD）工作流中。该解决方案结合了用于代码分析的 AgentCore、提供语义搜索能力的 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases，以及用于持续部署的 AWS CodePipeline。我们与一家专门在主要金融市场开展交易商间经纪业务的全球金融服务公司共同开发并验证了这种方法。自 2026 年第一季度以来，该方案一直在这家公司的生产环境中运行，用于维护其整个电子交易平台的架构文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "64bd9ea3cb2ceb12",
      "translationZh": "架构文档面临的挑战",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b11c50f83021b0f1",
      "translationZh": "开发团队在架构文档方面面临几个关键痛点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "74c16664c923970d",
      "translationZh": "耗时的手动流程——以统一建模语言（UML）或 Mermaid 等格式创建全面的架构图需要投入大量人力。对于大型代码库，这种方式难以持续。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "18b7eea697ed4211",
      "translationZh": "迅速过时——代码每天都在变化，但文档更新却滞后。几周之内，架构图就不再反映实际情况，因而无法作为可靠的决策依据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "de38b85e305c186f",
      "translationZh": "知识孤岛——团队成员离开时，团队内部口耳相传的知识也随之流失。遗留系统变成了“黑盒”，迫使新开发人员对代码进行逆向分析，拖慢了入职上手过程，并减少了组织积累的知识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5e79482e92cc845c",
      "translationZh": "合规缺口——安全审查和审计需要最新的架构图。过时的文档会带来合规风险，并延误认证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c932ab3f71b6ae6",
      "translationZh": "在微服务架构中，这些挑战会进一步加剧，因为了解服务依赖关系和消息流对于防止级联故障至关重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdc8e02692d445b4",
      "translationZh": "我们的解决方案使用 AgentCore 创建一个自主智能体，用于分析 .NET 代码库并生成全面的架构图。该智能体在 AWS CodePipeline 中运行，由向 AWS CodeCommit 存储库提交代码的操作触发。随后，生成的架构图及其元数据会被摄取到 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 中，以支持对架构文档的完整语料库进行语义搜索和自然语言查询。这让您能够更清晰地了解架构的当前状态，并利用这种程度的可见性释放业务价值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f87c0d1b3d86557",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案集成了多项 AWS 服务，以提供精简高效的工作流程：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf20aea036c4b167",
      "translationZh": "为我们的自主文档智能体提供无服务器运行时环境。AgentCore 负责智能体生命周期管理、自动扩缩容和工具编排，无需管理基础设施。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf1239df726d97d6",
      "translationZh": "编排从代码提交到文档发布的端到端工作流程。该流水线直接与 AWS CodeCommit 集成，每次向主分支推送代码时都会触发文档生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53dbdd2c7bcbe080",
      "translationZh": "Amazon 简单存储服务（Amazon S3）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4421cd3af399f9e",
      "translationZh": "存储生成的图表并托管文档网站，提供持久存储和全球访问能力。一个专用的 Architecture Diagrams 存储桶保存可缩放矢量图形（SVG）文件、Mermaid 源文件和图表元数据。Amazon S3 还充当 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 的向量存储后端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0b042543752c13e",
      "translationZh": "执行流水线的各个阶段，包括依赖安装、智能体调用和制品准备。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6d18f130fc3124b",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 知识库",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "016aea49ec90c6e2",
      "translationZh": "充当生成的架构文档的检索和展示层。存储在 Amazon S3 中的图表元数据、Mermaid 源文件和描述通过 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings 模型摄取到知识库中。它以 Amazon S3 作为向量存储，支持语义搜索和自然语言查询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ee73a623021c6ca",
      "translationZh": "以下架构图展示了整体系统设计，涵盖从将代码推送到 AWS CodeCommit，到生成图表，再到摄取至 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 的整个过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4b77f0ba1bdec0c",
      "translationZh": "图 1：从 AWS CodeCommit 经由图表生成到 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 摄取的整体系统设计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b29b28e9db2be891",
      "translationZh": "此工作流涉及以下步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1cc481b090f601ba",
      "translationZh": "开发者将代码更改推送到 AWS CodeCommit。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ce7be338b739d36",
      "translationZh": "AWS CodeCommit 触发 AWS CodePipeline 执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae9705eabcd73586",
      "translationZh": "AWS CodePipeline 启动构建过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83991f2aa1f4811e",
      "translationZh": "AWS CodeBuild 从 AWS CodeCommit 存储库获取代码，然后将源代码打包并上传到 Amazon S3 源代码存储桶。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d42a0fe5bd9fd9a",
      "translationZh": "AWS CodeBuild 调用 AgentCore。它准备调用负载，并调用托管在 AgentCore 上的 Strands 智能体。该智能体使用通过 Amazon Bedrock 提供的大语言模型作为推理引擎，以分析代码模式、生成图表语法，并自行纠正验证错误。有关各区域的模型可用性，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 中的“按 AWS 区域支持的模型”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "663e3ba943d2ab2f",
      "translationZh": "Strands 智能体从 Amazon S3 获取源代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "62fdb9fb27d01fa0",
      "translationZh": "Strands 智能体扫描代码库、生成图表、验证语法，并将图表转换为 SVG 文件，以进行迭代优化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b54cbf79750cb3b",
      "translationZh": "Strands 智能体将产物上传到 Amazon S3 架构图存储桶，包括渲染后的 SVG 文件、Mermaid 源文件和图表描述元数据（JSON）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5d0fbb93525f282",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 从 Amazon S3 架构图存储桶摄取图表产物。摄取流水线使用 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings v2 模型生成向量嵌入，通过分块将图表描述和 Mermaid 源内容划分为具有语义意义的单元，并将生成的向量存储在 Amazon S3 向量存储中。这支持对完整架构文档进行语义搜索和检索增强生成（RAG）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b5ef36c9d81cbda1",
      "translationZh": "开发人员和利益相关者通过自然语言查询知识库，以发现、探索和检索相关的架构图及其上下文说明：例如，询问“重新连接的活动流程是什么样的？”或“列出基础设施组件的所有类图。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3b1b31813371c7cb",
      "translationZh": "代码分析与优先级排序",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "206196f76a11dce3",
      "translationZh": "智能体首先分析代码库的结构。它并不处理每个文件，而是专注于生产代码，同时排除测试文件、构建产物和生成的代码。这种优先级排序减少了处理时间，并提高了图表的相关性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ccbe03ed8d05743d",
      "translationZh": "扫描会识别关键架构元素，包括接口、抽象类、具体实现及其依赖关系。这种结构化分析为智能体提供了生成准确图表所需的上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aadc4a32168119c8",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 部署文档智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6e902c83150bd65",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用 AgentCore 托管一个自主文档智能体，该智能体使用 Strands 智能体进行迭代改进和自我纠正。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33ea04915ad6095b",
      "translationZh": "智能体根据对代码库的分析以及图表生成的当前状态，决定如何使用工具。这种智能体式方法能够在出现验证错误时进行自我纠正，与单次 API 调用相比，显著提高了可靠性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5db0caaccc189fe7",
      "translationZh": "智能体遵循一种迭代工作流程，其方式与人类架构师处理文档工作的方式相仿：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70b88b484eb191e3",
      "translationZh": "图 2：涵盖理解、生成、验证、转换和发布阶段的迭代式智能体工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "581ad0d3c68d2633",
      "translationZh": "阶段 1——理解：智能体从 Amazon S3 获取源代码，并扫描代码库以理解整体结构，识别关键组件、接口及其关系。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7daa4499a086c370",
      "translationZh": "阶段 2——生成：针对每一种架构图类型，智能体使用通过 Amazon Bedrock 提供的基础模型，根据分析结果生成基于 Mermaid 的 UML。这些图包括类图、序列图、状态图、组件图和活动图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5535195931234505",
      "translationZh": "阶段 3——验证：每生成一张图后，智能体都会验证 Mermaid 语法。如果检测到错误，智能体会分析错误消息，并重新生成修正后的图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ef1d796be5bff1b",
      "translationZh": "阶段 4——转换：验证通过后，智能体会将图转换为 SVG 格式，以便在 Web 浏览器中进行高质量渲染。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b3ad994455365f5",
      "translationZh": "阶段 5——发布：智能体将产物、SVG 文件、Mermaid 源文件和图的元数据上传到 Amazon S3 Architecture Diagrams 存储桶。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c6435b0c10c2c7d",
      "translationZh": "这种迭代式方法的可靠性达到 95%，而单次 API 调用的可靠性为 65%，因为智能体能够自主检测并纠正错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "28b75d3412271b01",
      "translationZh": "AWS CodePipeline 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b134508218c57b08",
      "translationZh": "该流水线编排从代码提交到文档发布和知识库摄取的整个工作流：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c82ec5b9a2a60ab9",
      "translationZh": "该流水线使用 AWS CodeBuild 执行任务，提供具备必要依赖项的一致环境。AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 角色授予流水线相应权限，使其能够访问 AWS CodeCommit、调用 AgentCore、发布到 Amazon S3，以及触发 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 摄取。在发布步骤之后，摄取作业会将更新后的输出摄取到知识库中，使语义搜索索引随着每次代码变更保持最新。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c5c939883765854",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案生成多种输出格式。SVG 图提供高质量、可缩放的矢量图形。Mermaid 源文件提供可进行版本控制、可编辑的图表定义。元数据 JSON 文件为 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 的语义搜索层提供支持，以便通过自然语言查找图表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4b2c894c4dc4d932",
      "translationZh": "知识库配置与展示层",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc234fcadc62feb8",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案集成了全托管的 RAG 功能 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases，将其作为语义检索层，把静态图表转化为可查询的知识系统，并使其与代码库保持同步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13d9e59625db34ae",
      "translationZh": "对于每个生成的图表，智能体还会创建一个配套的元数据文件，与 SVG 和 Mermaid 文件一起存储在 Architecture Diagrams 存储桶中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cb72181d6b04eccc",
      "translationZh": "知识库设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "904bf53873106b34",
      "translationZh": "知识库配置包含三个组件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a5e65c5d5b0ca0b",
      "translationZh": "数据源：Amazon S3 Architecture Diagrams 存储桶，范围限定为 metadata/ 和 mermaid/ 前缀，以便仅对图表描述和源定义等语义丰富的内容建立索引，而非原始 SVG 二进制数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fa99fcd6bb5ad0e",
      "translationZh": "嵌入模型：Amazon Titan Text Embeddings v2 生成 1,024 维向量，每个分块最多支持 8,192 个词元，为图表内容提供高质量的语义表示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d61d49debe93c76",
      "translationZh": "向量存储：Amazon S3 用作向量存储后端，无需单独的向量数据库，并与该解决方案的无服务器方式保持一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37235f74692d6531",
      "translationZh": "分块策略：采用层次化分块，使用包含 1,500 个词元的父分块提供完整的图表上下文，使用包含 300 个词元的子分块进行细粒度的实体级检索。通过这一策略，知识库会根据查询返回完整的图表描述，或针对特定实体的聚焦回答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "18483dad5ae7a4bc",
      "translationZh": "查询知识库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "289d2c3aa82e659f",
      "translationZh": "摄取完成后，开发者可以通过 Amazon Bedrock 控制台、Amazon Bedrock AgentCore，或使用 RetrieveAndGenerate API 的自定义应用程序，以自然语言查询知识库。例如，“系统使用什么重连策略？”这样的查询会检索出活动图及其指数退避说明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d154da9d816077d",
      "translationZh": "知识库会在每次流水线运行时刷新，以使结果与代码库的变更保持同步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "388698af5682b86d",
      "translationZh": "了解成本结构有助于规划文档自动化策略。有关当前费率，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 定价。要估算具体使用情况下的成本，请使用 AWS Pricing Calculator。以下价格估算基于截至 2026 年 5 月的费率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "258101a39950897f",
      "translationZh": "每个代码仓库的成本明细",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "818e93c744d3ed2a",
      "translationZh": "对于包含约 1,500 个文件的中型代码仓库，成本明细如下。Amazon Bedrock 模型推理调用的费用取决于所选模型和词元用量。请参阅 AWS Pricing Calculator 获取估算值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e8253c98d384c5de",
      "translationZh": "输入词元：约 29,000 个词元。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f7987d71340e6de",
      "translationZh": "输出词元：约 10,000 个词元。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a1566c96a8f201c2",
      "translationZh": "每次生成的总费用：约 0.24。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c98b183af162b72",
      "translationZh": "AWS CodePipeline：每条活跃流水线每月 1.00（第一条流水线免费）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b56c18944e2490a1",
      "translationZh": "AWS CodeBuild：每构建分钟 0.005 × 5 分钟 = 每次执行 0.025",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58a1cfa860e2a41f",
      "translationZh": "Amazon S3 存储：文档产物的存储费用可忽略不计（通常小于 10 MB）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c546faa480dfa200",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases：摄取成本基于生成嵌入时 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings v2 的 token 用量。对于七张图所生成的元数据和 Mermaid 文件，每次摄取运行的嵌入成本通常低于 0.01。Amazon S3 向量存储的存储成本可忽略不计。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89264e71e3f1b0de",
      "translationZh": "每次生成的总成本：约 0.28。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "442677529d377c6e",
      "translationZh": "多代码仓库成本预估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e3140129eaa3c70",
      "translationZh": "对于拥有多个代码仓库的组织，每周文档更新的成本呈线性增长：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "52c950170be011eb",
      "translationZh": "5 个代码仓库：1.40/周 → 5.60/月。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fd430f2a8a19763a",
      "translationZh": "20 个代码仓库：5.60/周 → 22.40/月。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ceac7280938d742",
      "translationZh": "50 个代码仓库：14.00/周 → 56/月。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4dd801b4face2b32",
      "translationZh": "100 个代码仓库：28.00/周 → 112.00/月。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3f0e2a616d41a15b",
      "translationZh": "投资回报",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c726cf2dfedab66",
      "translationZh": "将自动化文档编写与手动方式进行比较时，投资回报（ROI）就会变得清晰：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14d6db75fec07e67",
      "translationZh": "图 3：自动化与手动文档编写的投资回报对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "641294a802805e60",
      "translationZh": "对于拥有 20 个代码仓库的组织，每年可在开发人员时间方面节省 2,000–8,000。此外，通过 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 使最新文档易于查找，还能改善入职培训、合规性和架构决策。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea46e5dd69e17f62",
      "translationZh": "本节将指导您在自己的 AWS 环境中部署该解决方案。我们将介绍前提条件、部署步骤和关键配置细节，以便让流水线针对您的代码库运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8544403ef6491521",
      "translationZh": "部署该解决方案之前，请确保已启用以下 AWS 服务、配置好权限，并具备相应的技术知识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5adf4e7def646e10",
      "translationZh": "AWS 账户设置：确保您的 AWS 账户可以访问 Amazon Bedrock，并已在目标区域启用 Claude Sonnet 和 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings v2（考虑到模型可用性，建议使用 us-east-1）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd22d053712e29f2",
      "translationZh": "IAM 权限：为 AWS CodePipeline 创建一个 AWS IAM 角色，并授予以下权限：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7a588e3e02339cff",
      "translationZh": "AWS CodeCommit 存储库访问权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5e0b8a1d9ccea189",
      "translationZh": "AWS CodeBuild 项目执行权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64a1414a9c95bcf4",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 的 StartIngestionJob 和 Retrieve 操作权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c15fc3d1f43e30c6",
      "translationZh": "Amazon S3 存储桶读写权限（源文件、图表和向量存储的存储桶）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ad1badfbceb070b",
      "translationZh": "Amazon CloudWatch Logs 创建权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "191e9f965bc93641",
      "translationZh": "AWS Cloud Development Kit (AWS CDK) 引导初始化：cdk bootstrap aws://ACCOUNT_ID/us-east-1 。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47c0ab91b485d85d",
      "translationZh": "技术技能（300–400 级要求）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "32d83c82b3d4a413",
      "translationZh": ".NET 代码库：你需要熟悉标准的 .NET 项目结构和常见编码模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6558dc63c6d1b646",
      "translationZh": "CI/CD 流水线：你需要基本了解自动化构建和部署流水线（最好是 AWS CodePipeline）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a3a23921d0bf81eb",
      "translationZh": "AWS CDK：你需要具备使用 AWS CDK 以基础设施即代码的方式部署基础设施的经验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "29bf12b923c62375",
      "translationZh": "架构可视化：你需要能够熟练解读技术图表和架构模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2bddc6a278068848",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库结构：此解决方案最适合遵循标准 .NET 项目约定的代码库，即源代码位于 src/ 目录中，且生产代码与测试代码明确分离。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0a735ae35166e26",
      "translationZh": "满足先决条件后，请按照以下步骤部署端到端流水线。每个步骤都以前一个步骤为基础，因此请按顺序完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "34a8e84e0bbf8737",
      "translationZh": "部署 AgentCore 智能体：使用 AgentCore CLI 将你的智能体代码打包并部署到 AWS。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb4f8850e7cf53fd",
      "translationZh": "创建 AWS CodePipeline：配置一个包含源代码、构建和部署阶段的流水线，并将其连接到你的 AWS CodeCommit 代码仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b350a91833bf1383",
      "translationZh": "配置 Amazon S3 存储桶：创建用于源代码暂存和文档托管的存储桶，并配置适当的生命周期策略。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e21c320d46779e18",
      "translationZh": "创建 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases：配置一个知识库，将 Amazon S3 架构图存储桶作为数据源（范围限定为 metadata/ 和 mermaid/ 前缀），将 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings v2 作为嵌入模型，并将 Amazon S3 作为向量存储。设置分层分块，父块大小为 1,500 个 token，子块大小为 300 个 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f1d597cb43295fed",
      "translationZh": "设置监控：配置 Amazon CloudWatch 告警，用于监控流水线故障和 AgentCore 调用错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a4547ed839c750b7",
      "translationZh": "测试流水线：在启用自动触发器之前，手动触发一次执行，以验证端到端功能，包括知识库摄取和查询结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "17d6395af269652e",
      "translationZh": "清理：为避免持续产生费用，请在不再需要时删除本演练过程中创建的资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d28695f06ff58f5a",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 通过将静态图转化为可搜索、可用自然语言查询的内容，加快开发者入职上手，支持安全的遗留系统现代化改造，支持满足审计要求的合规工作，并提升内容的可发现性。它还促进围绕微服务的跨团队协作，并通过生成的图将系统复杂性和依赖关系可视化，帮助识别技术债务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11e76985bb95b1fe",
      "translationZh": "对于一家全球性交易商间经纪商，该解决方案每周为 20 个代码仓库和服务生成七种类型的图，使其电子交易平台的架构文档保持最新。这为合规审计、开发者入职上手以及跨团队了解实时交易流程中的服务依赖关系提供了支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd84655c07256965",
      "translationZh": "自 2025 年 12 月以来，该解决方案一直在一家大型金融服务公司的生产环境中运行。这家公司是 AWS 的战略客户，业务涉及 20 个代码仓库，每周生成超过 140 张架构图，且没有任何人工操作开销。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7373b1ea6c2d2d71",
